Output tapes/crush-pmoves-session.gif
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Tokyo Night"
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# Crush session — pair programming with GLM-5.2"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "crush"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# Crush loads context: CRUSH.md, AGENT_TRAIL, agent_signatures.yaml"
Sleep 2s

Type "# ◇ Crush ready — companion voice, sky blue #0EA5E9"
Sleep 2s

Type "> Check the status of all PMOVES services"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# Crush invokes make -C pmoves health-quick via bash tool"
Sleep 2s

Type "# 27/33 services healthy — cipher-api, nats, qdrant, tensorzero all green"
Sleep 2s

Type "> Good. Write a trail entry for this session"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# Crush writes graphiti block to docs/AGENT_TRAIL.md"
Sleep 2s

Type "# Signed with ◇ glyph, companion voice"
Sleep 1s

Type "# Trail entry complete — make sign-trail AGENT=crush SUMMARY='session check'"
Sleep 2s
